From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] icu: the whole ICU C API .NET binds, forwarded to the host's ICU

icu.dll has every ICU function .NET's System.Globalization.Native binds, as Windows' icu.dll does, forwarded to the host's ICU (libicu76); .NET 5 and later aborted at startup when icu.dll lacked one.
---
diff --git a/dlls/icu/Makefile.in b/dlls/icu/Makefile.in
index 58df33d..483b515 100644
--- a/dlls/icu/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/icu/Makefile.in
@@ -1,5 +1,9 @@
 MODULE    = icu.dll
+UNIXLIB   = icu.so
+UNIX_LIBS = -licuuc -licui18n
 
 SOURCES = \
+	host.c \
 	uchar.c \
-	uregex.c
+	uregex.c \
+	unixlib.c
